# Optional. Copy to .env.local to build a copy where people can log in to YouTube and Kick
# without creating their own developer apps (read by core/build.rs at build time).
# .env.local is git-ignored. Never commit it, and never put these values in the source.
# Twitch needs nothing here, and StreamElements / Streamlabs log in through their own websites.
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_ID=
YOUTUBE_CLIENT_SECRET=
KICK_CLIENT_ID=
KICK_CLIENT_SECRET=
